17.3.m:
Indra and Agni, do you two strengthen the unswerving brick.
With your back you force apart heaven and earth and the intermediate space.
You are the queen, the eastern quarter;
you are the sovereign ruler, the southern quarter;
you are the imperial ruler, the western quarter;
you are the self-ruler, the northern quarter;
you are the overlady, the high quarter.
Protect my life;
protect my out-breath;
protect my through-breath;
protect my in-breath;
protect my sight;
protect my hearing;
swell my mind;
quicken my speech;
protect my self;
grant me light.
