For life [I place] you;
for splendor [I place] you;
for agriculture [I place] you;
for security [I place] you.
The controller is the ruler;
you are the controller, the restrainer;
you are firm, the maintainer.
For food [I place] you;
for nourishment [I place] you;
for wealth [I place] you;
for prosperity [I place] you.

17.4.m:
