the firmament is the thirty-sixfold;
the turning away is the forty-eightfold;
the support is the catuṣṭoma.
You are the share of Agni;
the lordship is of the consecration;
the brāhmaṇa is won;
the trivṛt is the stoma.
You are the share of Indra;
the lordship is of Viṣṇu;
the kṣatriya is won;
the fifteenfold is the stoma.
You are the share of the men-watchers;
