the quadruped is won;
the twenty-fourfold is the stoma.
You are the share of the Ādityas;
the lordship is of the Maruts;
the embryos are won;
the twenty-fivefold is the stoma.
You are the share of Aditi;
the lordship is of Pūṣan;
