the twenty-sevenfold is the stoma.
You are the share of the divine Savitṛ;
the lordship is of Bṛhaspati;
the matching quarters are won;
the catuṣṭoma is the stoma.
You are the share of the barley-months;
the lordship is of the non-barley-months;
offspring are won;
the forty-fourfold is the stoma.
You are the share of the Ṛbhus;
the lordship is of all the gods;
the created world is quieted;
the thirty-threefold is the stoma.

17.5.m:
With one they praised;
